            "description": "As an end user, I want to select a competition and season with a clear default, so that I can follow the matches that interest me across several tournaments.\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**\n1  Bootstrap displays authorized competitions and seasons only, in the configured order. A single competition must not create a redundant All option.\n2  Select the user's last valid context, then the tenant default. All is an explicit option and does not conflict with first-league defaults.\n3  Changing competition updates fixtures and related details and cancels older requests. Store context in the URL without credentials.\n4  On access changes or when no competitions are available, use a valid fallback context or a clear empty state rather than displaying unauthorized cached data.\n\nRequired Changes  Update wc-app competition and season selectors, route-query state and bootstrap models. Provide horizontally scrollable mobile tabs with keyboard support and RTL/LTR layouts.\n\nDependencies  BE05 and BE06.\n\n--- [ZOHO-ACTUAL-DELIVERY v1 | SNA-130-2026-10-28-01] ---\nملحق مراجعة التنفيذ (لا يغيّر الحالة أو معايير القبول): مراجعة BMAD 10.6 تشير إلى سياق افتراضي/All في تنفيذ PWA، بينما القصة تشترط آخر سياق صالح ثم default المستأجر، مع All كخيار صريح لا يتعارض مع افتراضي الدوري الأول. التنفيذ الحالي مختلف/غير محسوم، ولم يُتحقق تشغيليًا في هذه الجولة. الأدلة: BMAD 10.6؛ sprint-status.yaml وepics.md.\n--- [/ZOHO-ACTUAL-DELIVERY | SNA-130-2026-10-28-01] ---",
